 Express Train, with clear route details, ticket tips and real examples.\n4. Flytoget vs Vy Train Oslo Airport 2026: Which to Take? [authoritative] — https://www.oslo-spirit.com/guides/flytoget-vs-train/\n   Should I take Flytoget or the Vy train from Oslo Airport? For most travellers, the Vy regional train is the better choice: it costs NOK 124 (USD 13) vs NOK 243 (USD 26) and is only 6-10 minutes slower (25-30 min vs 19 min). Take Flytoget if you value absolute speed and reliability — it's marginally faster and slightly...\nNext step: webFetch https://flytoget.no/en/tickets","type":"text"}],"details":{"cacheAgeMs":0,"cacheHit":false,"candidateCount":10,"compressionMode":"normal","effectiveQuery":"Oslo airport train Flytoget tickets","fallbackUsed":false,"followUpQueries":[],"freshness":"any","intent":"general","networkEvidence":{"artifactIds":["art_f81c33e816fa6d50f62f93867ed1d9ea","art_d40c9fc86e44cfd1e03f2cbe0b7ad3f1"],"fallbackUrlsFetched":false,"trust":"untrusted"},"preferCorroboration":false,"preferredSourceUrls":["https://flytoget.no/en/tickets","https://www.thetraveler.org/how-to-use-flytoget-for-easy-oslo-airport-transfers/","https://www.thetraveler.org/flytoget-in-norway-routes-tickets-and-train-tips-for-travelers/","https://www.oslo-spirit.com/guides/flytoget-vs-train/"],"probeElapsedMs":924,"query":"Oslo airport train Flytoget tickets","resultCount":4,"results":[{"authoritative":false,"fetchRisk":"medium","score":42,"scoreReasons":["query_term_match","provider_position:1","topical_terms:5/5"],"snippet":"Flytoget is the fastest and most comfortable way to travel between Oslo Airport and Oslo Central Station, taking only 19 minutes with departures every 10 minutes. Buy your tickets here.","sourceKind":"general","title":"Buy tickets for Flytoget Airport Express train here! - flytoget.no","url":"https://flytoget.no/en/tickets"},{"authoritative":false,"fetchRisk":"medium","score":35,"scoreReasons":["query_term_match","provider_position:3","topical_terms:5/5"